# Project map

Single-page app. `GET /` concatenates partials in `_web/respond.py` `send_app_page`: `static/shell.html`, `static/features/dialer.html`, `static/features/performance.html`, `static/features/prospects.html`, `static/features/settings.html`, `static/shell-end.html`. Tabs switch in `static/_core/navigation.js` (`setDashboardTab`). There is no router.

## Folders

- `server.py`, `web.py`, `dialer.py` — process entry; `dialer.py` only calls `serve()`
- `features/` — routes and rules (`dialer.py`, `metrics.py`, `prospects.py`, `settings.py`, `accounts.py`)
- `features/_dialer/` — server session, queue, Twilio, outcomes, projection
- `features/_prospects/` — CSV import/export and local/Supabase storage
- `shared/` — `config.py`, `vocabulary.py` (constants only), `dial_policy.py` (pool, caps, connect, callbacks), `infra.py`; `shared/_infra/` is Supabase and file helpers
- `_web/` — `respond.py` (page, static, JSON) and `hooks.py` (Twilio webhook)
- `static/` — `main.js` boot, `core.js` re-exports, shell partials
- `static/_core/` — browser `state`, API client, navigation, format helpers
- `static/features/` — page partials and feature entry scripts
- `static/features/_dialer/`, `_prospects/`, `_performance/`, `_arcade/` — feature parts
- `static/css/` — base styles `01`–`09`; `static/css/linear/` loads after and overrides
- `tests/`, `scripts/`, `docs/` — tests, checks, design notes (`docs/` describes an older target tree)

## Pages

- Dialer: `static/features/dialer.html` `#dialerTabPanel`; JS `static/features/dialer.js` and `static/features/_dialer/`
- Prospects: `static/features/prospects.html` `#prospectsTabPanel`; JS `static/features/prospects.js` and `static/features/_prospects/`
- Caller pool: `#poolTabPanel` is in `static/features/prospects.html`; render `static/features/_dialer/pool-view.js`; timezone `static/features/_dialer/pool.js`
- Performance: `static/features/performance.html` `#metricsPanel` wraps only `#performanceTabPanel`. JS `static/features/performance.js`. `setDashboardTab` shows `#metricsPanel` only on the Performance tab; Prospects/Pool/Dials panels are siblings in `#dashboard-top-row`.

## Layout, tokens, charts

- Chrome: `static/shell.html` (`.app-shell`, `.side-nav`, `#loginGate`). Page frame (`main`, `#crmView`, `.page-heading`, `.dashboard-stack`) opens in `static/features/dialer.html` and closes in `static/features/prospects.html`.
- Layout CSS: `static/css/02-layout.css`, `static/css/09-shell.css`. Overrides: `static/css/linear/shell.css`, `static/css/linear/document.css`.
- Tokens: `static/css/01-tokens.css` `:root` (`--ink`, `--canvas`, `--primary`, radii). That file also has shell rules; do not add more there.
- Charts: `static/features/_performance/charts.js` (`buildMetricsLineChart`, `buildStatusPieChart`, `buildConnectionPieChart`). Markup in `static/features/performance.html`. Styles `static/css/05-charts.css`, then `static/css/linear/metrics.css`.

## Styling

Plain CSS. Link order in `static/shell.html` is the cascade: `01-tokens.css` through `09-shell.css`, then `css/linear/*`. Numbered files use `var(--*)`. `linear/` repeats those colors as hex and wins on equal specificity. Edit the rule that currently wins, and use a token from `01-tokens.css` instead of a new hex. Reuse classes already on the nodes (`side-link`, `dialer-document`, `stat-tile`, `button-primary`).

## Dialer and metrics state

- Snapshot: `static/_core/state.js` `state` (`leads`, `pool`, `metrics`, dialer flags) and `S` (poll clock, tab, voice, session UI).
- Fetch: `static/features/_dialer/poller.js` `refreshState` every 1.5s — `GET /api/live`, `GET /api/leads` when `leads_version` changes (not full `/api/state`), `GET /api/metrics` every 15s into `state.metrics`. Client merge helpers: `static/_core/sync-state.js`. Then `render()` in `static/_core/render.js`.
- Dialer paint: `static/features/_dialer/render-dialer.js`, registered from `static/features/dialer.js`.
- Metrics paint: `static/features/performance.js` `renderMetrics`.
- Server: `features/dialer.py` `GET /api/state` (dialer snapshot, no lead rows), `GET /api/leads` (CRM table + pool), `GET /api/live`. `features/metrics.py` `GET /api/metrics`.
